  "statuteText": "650-A:1 Felonious Use of Firearms. –\n\nA person is guilty of a class B felony if he commits or attempts to commit any felony when armed with a pistol, revolver, rifle, shotgun or any other firearm. For any subsequent offense, a person shall be guilty of a class A felony."
